      "slug": "unknown",
      "label": "Unknown",
      "children": [],
      "notes": "F49 (PROGRESS.md): a technical sentinel, not an editorial category. Deliberately has no `subtype` children -- it stands in for 'not yet classified', so there is nothing under it to select. type_relations.json gives it exclude_same=true and zero complements so an unclassified place fails closed on competitor exclusion regardless of `status`, unlike the old editorial/city-guide loader sentinel (F27) which had exclude_same=false and complemented every venue type. E2.1 reclassifies every place currently wearing this label into a real type; nothing should be left as `unknown` at launch."
